WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.162
The rest of the gaps are about safety.

2
00:00:02.162 --> 00:00:05.894
Nothing in the samples reads
before writing, offers a dry run,

3
00:00:05.894 --> 00:00:09.551
or reads back afterward, and
nothing checks for the lockout.

4
00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:13.873
The tutorial asks for a year of
eligibility, twice what the program allows

5
00:00:13.873 --> 00:00:17.913
for that tier, and for permissions
far broader than the request needs.

6
00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:20.363
Its clean-up would
delete the wrong object.

7
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:22.842
So the verdict is clear:
keep Learn's read,

8
00:00:22.842 --> 00:00:27.725
its rule shapes and its write permission,
but don't run the samples as published.

9
00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:29.980
Let's look at what the
code builds instead.
